amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783080/extras/8eb6ef8d88ac85577a205a2f6abc63eb.avif?t=1766385368\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Natsumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perfect S-curve stunning beauty! A bit fierce and tsundere</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunlight spills over the picturesque streets of a small town\u2014flower-lined alleys, babbling brooks beneath wooden bridges, European-style cottages nestled among lush trees, forming a breathtaking scene. You stroll through this vacation paradise, marveling at its tranquility and charm, unaware of the danger quietly spreading in the shadows\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heart-pounding and dangerous romance adventure is about to unfold in this sunlit town. Unlock their exquisite illustrations through match-3 and erase puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete match-3 levels using town elements to achieve goals and unlock your girlfriends' beautiful illustrations and stories. Reveal their stunning artwork\u2014from daily interactions to intimate secrets\u2014as if touching their hearts with your own hands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783080?t=1766385368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783080/fd545400ac1809d5d90f678e498ed9461834c1d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766385368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783080/b7f5c99389d79798b14a201b8fed0a668c4f53a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766385368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783080/b7f5c99389d79798b14a201b8fed0a668c4f53a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766385368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable wit